	(text "STM32 Prototype Rev B (Blue-Pill compatible)\nD1 STM32F103C8T6 | D2 USB-C 2.0 device | D3 AP2112K-3.3 | D4 USBLC6-2SC6 + 500 mA PTC\nD5 Cortex-Debug 10-pin + SWD 1x4 | D6 Qwiic I2C1 (PB6/PB7) 4.7k | D7 RESET + BOOT0 buttons\nD8 power LED + PC13 user LED | D9 LSE 32.768 kHz (DNP) | D10 Blue-Pill format | D11 2 layers 1.6 mm\nD12 0603, JLC basic parts preferred | D13 JLCPCB assembly, LCSC field on every part"
